E ProgressionSubject                     | BrushSpecification.h | 110-117 | contract                      | -  | How a dynamic moves across its declared interval. to every artist who has used a stylus, and a brush that cannot state its own progression is a brush every artist immediately abandons. `ProgressionCount` is the undeclared value and is refused.
